/Title (On the same day, as the 1st part of the Canonical Visit was conducted by Rev. Mother L. Jeya Mary, FIHM, Superior General, Pondicherry, accompanied by Rev. Sr. Ethelvina Mary Balakumari, FIHM, the general secretary. During the visit, all statutory records, institutional files, and registers were meticulously verified and reviewed. An interactive session was held with the faculty members focusing on the college strength, geographical location, academic environment, and the overall functioning of the institution. Faculty appointments, salary structure, and service conditions were discussed in detail.  As a mark of respect and gratitude, Dr. C. Bavithra, HR and Head of the Department of Mathematics, presented a shawl to Rev. Mother L. Jeya Mary, FIHM, and Mrs. Syedalifathima, Head of the Department of Computer Science, presented a token of love. Similarly, Ms. Sathya, Dean, Head of the Department of Commerce, presented a shawl to Rev. Sr. Ethelvina Mary Balakumari, FIHM, and Mrs. T. Poorima, AP/Mathematics, presented a token of love. At the end of the staff meeting, Rev. Mother L. Jeya Mary, FIHM, graciously presented a gift and bestowed her motherly blessings upon the management, and the faculty members.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 468 0 R
>>
endobj
