/Title (Concurrently, the I, II, and III year English department students visited Vivekanandha College to attend the Drama Festival, where the play Romeo and Juliet was staged. The programme provided the students with valuable exposure to dramatic performance and enhanced their understanding of Shakespearean drama.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 469 0 R
>>
